From d4fa963f1f50704efbb24959bafff8faf6bbcae6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Samuel Braun <sam@webry.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 15:18:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(session): moved-on close counts the new stop; a worker
 panic ends the stop

on_worker answers StopMovedOn after a panic (state MovedOn) and logs
it. The moved-on close test resolves step 1 in yamt, so only the new
stop's count passes. DiskVersion::next is the one next-version rule;
highest_disk_version and open_after are tested. The merge-abort test
joins abort_continue.rs.

Refs #1427 #1428 #1429 #1430 #1433 #1434 #1435
